---
import { PHONE, PHONE_FULL } from "../constants";
---

<div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl text-left">New Client Openings for 2027</h2>
    <p>
        I am now accepting applications for four to six (4-6) new clients
        beginning in 2027.
    </p>
    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-loose">How to Apply</h3>
    <p>
        Please call or text me to set up a meet and greet with you and your pet:{" "}
        <a
            href={`tel:${PHONE_FULL}`}
            class="inline-flex items-center underline font-black underline-offset-2 text-blue-500"
        >
            📞 {PHONE}
        </a>
        <br />
        A meet and greet gives us a chance to meet face to face, discuss your
        pet's grooming needs, and make sure we're a good fit before booking your
        first appointment.
        <br />
    </p>
    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-loose">Schedule Requirement</h3>
    <p>
        To be considered for one of these openings,{" "}
        <b>your dog must remain on a regular 4-to-6-week grooming schedule.</b>{" "}
        <br />
        Consistent appointments keep your pet comfortable, keep their coat
        healthy, and allow me to reserve dedicated time for each dog on my
        schedule.
    </p>
    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-loose">About My Openings</h3>
    <p>
        As a small grooming business, I keep my client list intentionally
        limited so every dog receives patient, one-on-one attention. Spots fill
        quickly, so reach out early if you're interested.
    </p>
    <br />
    <p>
        Thank you! I look forward to meeting you and your furry family member!
    </p>
</div>
